# Keeps the kits' own tests and helpers out of the tarball.
#
# The `files` allowlist ships `.readyup` wholesale, because the publishing kit's `describeFilesCoverage`
# accepts only an entry naming the directory or the package root -- a narrower glob would fail the check
# readyup runs on itself. An ignore file nested inside an included directory is the one lever that still
# prunes: a package-root `.npmignore` is overridden by `files`, this is not.
__tests__/
test-utils/
